19:["$","$L44",null,{"firstTake":"I modelled the product around vehicles, because that is how the fleet data was structured — one record per truck, with trips hanging off it.","whatChangedIt":"Every field session contradicted it. Managers never said a registration number; they said “the Chennai trip”. The data model matched the database, not the way anyone actually worked.","whatIDid":"Rebuilt the information architecture around the trip as the core operational unit, with vehicles as an attribute of it. Exception handling — reroutes, driver swaps — moved into the trip states rather than being bolted on afterwards.","cost":"Roughly two weeks of IA and early screens thrown away, before any UI was built."}]
1a:["$","section",null,{"children":[["$","$L5",null,{"label":"Learnings","title":"What This Project","accent":"Taught Me"}],["$","div",null,{"className":"grid grid-cols-1 gap-8 lg:grid-cols-2","children":[["$","$L7",null,{"children":["$","div",null,{"className":"space-y-5","children":[["$","div","Workflow-first UX thinking",{"className":"flex items-start gap-3 border-t border-ink/[0.07] pt-4 first:border-0 first:pt-0","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"mt-0.5 shrink-0 text-[color:var(--accent)]","children":"→"}],["$","div",null,{"children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"text-[13px] font-semibold text-ink","children":"Workflow-first UX thinking"}],["$","div",null,{"className":"mt-1 text-[13px] leading-relaxed text-ink/62","children":"The best interface decisions came from mapping the operational reality first — not from UI patterns. Understanding what fleet managers actually do before designing how they do it was essential."}]]}]]}],["$","div","Enterprise dashboard hierarchy",{"className":"flex items-start gap-3 border-t border-ink/[0.07] pt-4 first:border-0 first:pt-0","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"mt-0.5 shrink-0 text-[color:var(--accent)]","children":"→"}],["$","div",null,{"children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"text-[13px] font-semibold text-ink","children":"Enterprise dashboard hierarchy"}],["$","div",null,{"className":"mt-1 text-[13px] leading-relaxed text-ink/62","children":"In high-pressure operational environments, visual hierarchy isn't aesthetic — it's functional. Wrong prioritization means missed alerts and operational failures."}]]}]]}],["$","div","Operational visibility design",{"className":"flex items-start gap-3 border-t border-ink/[0.07] pt-4 first:border-0 first:pt-0","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"mt-0.5 shrink-0 text-[color:var(--accent)]","children":"→"}],["$","div",null,{"children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"text-[13px] font-semibold text-ink","children":"Operational visibility design"}],["$","div",null,{"className":"mt-1 text-[13px] leading-relaxed text-ink/62","children":"Visibility is a feature, not a side effect. Every screen had to answer 'what does the user need to know right now?' before 'what can we show them?'"}]]}]]}],["$","div","Human-centered logistics systems",{"className":"flex items-start gap-3 border-t border-ink/[0.07] pt-4 first:border-0 first:pt-0","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"mt-0.5 shrink-0 text-[color:var(--accent)]","children":"→"}],["$","div",null,{"children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"text-[13px] font-semibold text-ink","children":"Human-centered logistics systems"}],["$","div",null,{"className":"mt-1 text-[13px] leading-relaxed text-ink/62","children":"Behind every data point is a driver, a fleet manager, a branch coordinator. Designing for the human context — not just the data model — was what made the system usable under pressure."}]]}]]}],["$","div","Designing for real-world operational environments",{"className":"flex items-start gap-3 border-t border-ink/[0.07] pt-4 first:border-0 first:pt-0","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"mt-0.5 shrink-0 text-[color:var(--accent)]","children":"→"}],["$","div",null,{"children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"text-[13px] font-semibold text-ink","children":"Designing for real-world operational environments"}],["$","div",null,{"className":"mt-1 text-[13px] leading-relaxed text-ink/62","children":"This is a tool used during crisis — a delayed vehicle, a missed delivery, a fuel discrepancy. It must be calm, clear, and fast when the user is not."}]]}]]}]]}]}],["$","$L6",null,{"className":"flex flex-col justify-center","children":[["$","h3",null,{"className":"mb-4 text-[15px] font-bold text-[color:var(--accent)]","children":"Final Reflection"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"mb-4 leading-relaxed text-ink/72","children":"Kudra was more than a fleet management dashboard."}],["$","p",null,{"className":"mb-4 leading-relaxed text-ink/70","children":"It was an operational transformation proj